        /// says what its slots may hold.
        ///
        /// Its slots are plain function pointers, read only through a shared borrow, so a
        /// table is `Send` and `Sync`, and a `static` may hold one:
        ///
        /// ```
        /// use std::ffi::c_int;
        /// use std::sync::LazyLock;
